Z||000007||Cliff Pennock||06-15-2000||07:00 PM||||You did the right thing. Sooner or later assholes like these will meet someone who will not walk away and who will simply tear them apart and not think twice about it.<P>But I know how you feel. At moments like that there's nothing more you would like than ripping the guy's face off. Been there, done that. And they're not worth the energy.||||reg||1
